From c7df7d8e38ebfe960b6244b99c8f768400803b5d Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: SAMUHIA Web <info@samuhia.co.ke>
Date: Fri, 30 Oct 2026 11:02:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add Landlord Watch and House to Rent feature pages, update
 SEO and LLM files

- New /features/ index plus /features/landlord-watch/ and /features/house-to-rent/
  (content in src/content/features.json, builder in src/pages/features.js)
- Per-feature title, description, canonical, Service + FAQPage + Breadcrumb JSON-LD
- Markdown twins, llms.txt and llms-full.txt include the new features
- Sitemap picks up the new pages automatically
- Plot Yangu product page: feature list, facts, FAQ and a Featured capabilities section
- Footer gets a Features column; organization knowsAbout extended
- Public copy describes outcomes and privacy behaviour only (no internals)
